    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9883" root="خبث" body-key="x">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُخْبِثْ</span></b>  One <i>who teaches others to be bad, wicked,</i>
or <i>deceitful:</i> and some allow it to be applied to
one <i>who attributes,</i> or <i>imputes, to others what
is bad, wicked,</i> or <i>the like.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَبِيثٌ</span>, in four places.

